  ---
  Delete Account

  Endpoint
  DELETE /api/v1/auth/account

  Headers
  Authorization: Bearer {access_token}
  Content-Type: application/json

  Request Body
  None required.

  Success Response 200
  {
    "message": "Account deleted"
  }

  Error Response 401 — token missing or expired
  {
    "message": "Unauthenticated."
  }

  Behavior
  - Works for both owner and renter roles
  - Permanently deletes: account, all listings, all listing photos, avatar, notifications, wishlist, chats, device sessions
  - All storage files are wiped — this is irreversible

  ---
  Displaying Images

  All images (listing photos and avatars) are stored as full URLs in the API response. You use them directly in an <img> tag or your framework's image
  component.

  Listing photo URLs come from:
  GET /api/v1/listings/{id}
  {
    "photos": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "url": "https://flatnest.techrealify.com/storage/listings/{id}/filename.jpg",
        "position": 0
      }
    ]
  }

  Avatar URL comes from:
  GET /api/v1/auth/me  (or login/register response)
  {
    "user": {
      "avatar_url": "https://flatnest.techrealify.com/storage/avatars/filename.jpg"
    }
  }

  Usage examples:

  React / React Native:
  <Image source={{ uri: photo.url }} />

  Image constraints (for frontend validation before upload):

  ┌───────────────┬────────────────┬──────────┐
  │     Field     │ Allowed types  │ Max size │
  ├───────────────┼────────────────┼──────────┤
  │ Listing photo │ jpg, jpeg, png │ 200 KB   │
  ├───────────────┼────────────────┼──────────┤
  │ Avatar        │ jpg, jpeg, png │ 200 KB   │
  └───────────────┴────────────────┴──────────┘

